      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this fantastic two-bedroom end of terrace perfectly situated on the highly sought-after Ratoath Road in Cabra, Dublin 7.\n\nRatoath Road is one of Dublin 7's most sought after locations, benefiting from close proximity to the City Centre, Phoenix Park, Phibsborough and Stoneybatter. The surrounding area offers a wealth of amenities including shops, schools, TU Dublin Grangegorman, and a variety of cafes and restaurants. Excellent public transport links are right on your doorstep, including LUAS, train, and frequent bus services. There is also easy access to the N3, M50, and Dublin Airport, which is just a 20-minute drive.\n\nThis superb home offers bright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 63 sq.m and comprises of a storm porch, entrance hallway, lounge, dining, fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms and main family bathroom.\nNo.55 comes to the market in great condition throughout and boasts gas fired central heating, light filled interior, quality flooring throughout and an extra large sunny rear garden with side entrance and barna shed.\n\nAn opportunity not to be missed! Viewing is strongly advised; call Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 01 6995050 today for further information or to arrange viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n- c. 63 sqm\n- BER F\n- 2 bed/ 1 bath\n- End of terrace\n- Gas-fired central heating\n- Front driveway\n- Large rear garden\n- Mature and sought-after location\n- Within walking distance of Broombridge Luas and train station\n- Excellent primary and secondary schools in the area\n- Easy access to M50 Motorway\n- Close to Dublin Airport\n- Walking distance of Cabra, Phibsborough and Stoneybatter villages\n- Ideal for first time buyers and investors\n- Early viewing highly advised"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 2"
      }
